    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎆</span><strong><span>本期小fool人</span></strong><span>：小鹿/ 颜悦/ 航哥/ 鸟鸟/ 颜怡/ 三弟/ 贝小方🎆</span></p><p><strong><span>特别信息</span></strong><span>：小鹿脱口秀专场《中女时代》将于 </span><strong><span>2026/01/23 中午12点</span></strong><span> 在 </span><strong><span>B站充电频道「好笑那个小鹿」</span></strong><span> 正式上线！!</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTkbEcAMdPiXq-k92q2s7VnnfjN.JPG"></figure><p><span>🪽时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 《我的中女时代》线上版要来啦！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 出门在外，年终deadline都是自己给的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 航哥享受不创作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 把精力留给快乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> 拒绝与解释的分离训练</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">15:18</a> 对抗脑内反刍的三件小工具</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 三弟：身体的修行让人忘记很多苦恼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> 鸟鸟的早餐革命</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a> 三胞胎：Doja Cat的现场震撼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2896">48:16</a> 蟑螂行动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3186">53:06</a> 小鹿的2025：最喜欢12月31号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 如何制作一个专场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3604">01:00:04</a> 创造更大的自由</span></p>]]></description>
