  <item>
    <title>043. 从伍尔夫到我们：一间房的多重宇宙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e9534e525f51df38afbbf0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e9534e525f51df38afbbf0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 18:50:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🧙‍♀️本期小fool人：✨星悦/ 颜悦/ 颜怡/ 三弟/ 贝小方🧙‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下录制场又来咯！本期我们来到一家书店，从“自己的房间”聊起：</span></p><span></span><p><span>伍尔夫的经典之作《一间只属于自己的房间》里提到，女性要想真正通过自己的声音创作，首先需要一间属于自己的房间，我们从房间的角度展开，本意探讨空间对自由和创作的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有想到，不但主播们越聊越多，本期后半段的听众发言也让人非常惊喜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在听的人，祝你自由，祝你叛逆，祝你有时写出潦草的情书！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvPin0iDfY6v4ZNboc4a56XEKJc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>⏳ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 三弟豪气开场（以亏损为指标）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 星悦的</span><strong><span>70年代芭比梦幻怪怪屋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a>假装已独居的双胞胎合租</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 小方衣柜里的情绪分区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a>“房间自主权”和改造力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> 星悦的家庭回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 群居的隐私就复杂多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 打扮空间这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 上铺惊魂记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 工厂宿舍、有尊严的气质，和一颗光荣的大白菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 星悦推荐之《In Defense of Witches》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a> 颜悦推荐之《凯列班与女巫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 颜怡推荐之《扫地出门：美国城市的贫穷与暴利》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">51:12</a>三弟推荐之《星辰时刻》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 第三空间的魔法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 大宇宙小fool人支招：社交场合到底咋退出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> 听众文学水平极高！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">01:08:00</a> 祝你开始自由</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlGjVuSMDjITusp1hHlNrFxaeI6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvaRM7EeiVuSaekEyBXh2I7G5boi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📚 提到的作品</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一间属于自己的房间》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《In Defense of Witches》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《凯列班与女巫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《厌女简史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《扫地出门：美国城市的贫穷与暴利》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《星辰时刻》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《口水涟涟》 by 金爱烂</span></p><span></span><p><span>《鹤妻》 by 朱天心</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjhKHI50yTTVVMp5bo_2qs8ndb5L.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【图】星悦设计的生理解剖图示</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FisocwifNdCJ5D_LUdnHQrUt7Wpa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【图】某接受采访给出建设性观点的银渐层</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FotRCaQqYCLVPGewtBcF7iW75inC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📣鸣谢</span></p><span></span><p><span>场地支持：果麦书店（上海）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主办方：果麦文化 三好姐妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>活动统筹：751</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhE5amAR8KizlIj2pB0MrxKyEHef.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
