    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 14:53:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍑本期小fool人： </span><strong><span>步惊云/ 周欣雨/ 鸟鸟/ 三弟</span></strong><span> 🍑</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，我们把舞台的魔力、偶然性和必然性摆到桌面上聊，也把他们看不见的心路历程说给你听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在播客里，没有必须控制的时长，来听我们笑谈身为演员在幕后的窘态，袒露身处其中的执念。或许正是这些不确定和不完美，让舞台充满生命力吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次，你会听见我们背后的摇摆，也会听见段子里最赤裸的诚意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>特定的舞台有不少玄学，有的段子从不缺真心。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⏳时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a> 今年喜欢的亮点脱口秀演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">00:07:20</a> 周欣雨说不出口的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">00:08:00</a> 鸟鸟总编剧感想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">00:11:35</a> 三弟对脱口秀节目和竞赛的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> 辣评《脱Ta》评委团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">00:17:30</a>“贫贱夫妻百事哀”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">00:18:52</a> 舞台玄学的一些花絮分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">00:27:26</a>「深耕线下」的大鹅与节目组坐绿皮火车的趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">00:32:30</a> 步姐今年创作的真心话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">00:54:50</a> 聊聊杨笠的专场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3551">00:59:11</a>一颗跳动的榴莲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">01:04:45</a> 聊聊《豫见她们》</span></p>]]></description>
