/span></a><span>）；</span></p><span></span><p><span>航哥（</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b1645ef11be1061ec9b015e?xsec_token=YBS-TKgQUOAxe0FlvC2pBGZViiaZLrDD-ejNt4LqVZoNo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1747982604&amp;share_id=1cf820b0b0154d4dafa45d58bda23c3c" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b1645ef11be1061ec9b015e?xsec_token=YBS-TKgQUOAxe0FlvC2pBGZViiaZLrDD-ejNt4LqVZoNo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1747982604&amp;share_id=1cf820b0b0154d4dafa45d58bda23c3c"><span>@我是航哥</span></a><span>）；</span></p><span></span><p><span>贝小方 （</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6392a058000000001f01ab95?xsec_token=YBeP2EIhdXNlhPrA6HG6T0_6sTxYsAExtPopvVn01nWzA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6392a058000000001f01ab95&amp;apptime=1747191431&amp;share_id=d35b4dde1fef490f8c059da8a5df381f" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6392a058000000001f01ab95?xsec_token=YBeP2EIhdXNlhPrA6HG6T0_6sTxYsAExtPopvVn01nWzA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6392a058000000001f01ab95&amp;apptime=1747191431&amp;share_id=d35b4dde1fef490f8c059da8a5df381f"><span>@贝小方</span></a><span>）👭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj45KYhIWpiLpgPOPUdNQRsD26pd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>他们不是朋友，不是亲戚，却和你是在生活里默默在线的熟人关系。这期我们聊聊这些“熟悉的陌生人”到底为什么这么难忘～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧃这期是我们在「三好姐妹喜剧周」的特别录制，现场见到了许多可爱的听众，也请到了Norah一起加入聊天！感谢你点进来和我们一起回味这些“熟悉的陌生人”。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnFiGryqHJH80HkhB9bgIB27hOK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FukBMCorSwfbDj3uJPVb4SiEZOqC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FngFwNsaEEUZQsMohNEZk9g4oihI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlG5zzsNPa5tvOr6J7s1DKwTJcyY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FluuDu4NkAIproxynIfZrZrX5h-Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🔊 鸣谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主办方：「三好姐妹喜剧周」</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频技术支持：RODE 罗德</span></p><span></span><p><span>平台支持：小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>Norah团队：Spicy Comedy的姐妹们</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是三好姐妹播客企划「</span><a href="https://collection.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/xiaoguo" data-url="https://collection.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/xiaoguo"><span>女子笑有力量</span></a><span>」系列节目之一，欢迎收听本次企划的其他节目，以锋利又轻盈的姿态，畅聊女性日常经验里的烦恼与困惑，让她的笑声力量无限延续。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiOnlXtYmvICNf52aQJZHE0pkk5r.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📮哪个主播的故事最打动你呢？以及你生活里有没有这样的“非朋友”式熟人？ ta带给你什么影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎社交平台上分享时带话题 #小fool人#， 需要大家的支持！谢谢咯</span></p>]]></description>
